OL,3,GNEWSAHealth board admits failings that
OL,4,Aled to dementia patient's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS Tayside spokesperson said it was
OL,7,F"deeply sorry for the pain and grief
OL,8,Fthis has caused" and it had taken steps
OL,9,Fto prevent any similar incidents.
